      "writtenOn": "2026-07-09T15:47:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this `match`-based dispatching isn\u0027t that much different from using `Box\u003cdyn Read+Seek\u003e` (both dispatch at runtime, although the latter also has an overhead of a heap allocation + pointer hops).  Did you measure the performance difference when using `Box\u003cdyn Read+Seek\u003e`?\n\nI wonder how much of the performance gains comes from 1) avoiding virtual calls, vs 2) avoiding extra data copy via the buffer of `BufReader`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 218,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 218,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "d4d3d48d3873bd086a207a811f221186d80e61da",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dd3049e8_f0408b4a",
        "filename": "experimental/rust_bmp/ffi/FFI.rs",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 218,
      "author": {
        "id": 4159917
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-09T16:45:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did local tests running 100s of executions, and the results show that the enum input was consistently a little faster than a Box\u003cdyn BufRead + Seek\u003e\ninput, but only by ~1-1.6% on the tested files. Wrapping the in-memory cursor in\nBufReader was ~2-3% slower. The full SkStreamAdapter + BufReader path was much\nslower, roughly ~7-14% slower depending on the file.\n\nSo I agree that enum-vs-trait-object dispatch is not the main source of the win.\nThe main benefit is avoiding the SkStreamAdapter/CXX streaming path and BufReader\nmachinery. The enum still avoids an extra allocation and trait-object pointer\nhop, so I think it is reasonable to keep, but I updated the comment to avoid\nimplying that eliminating dispatch is the primary performance reason.\n\nI updated comments to reflect that",
      "parentUuid": "8363a6b8_a500016d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 218,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 218,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "d4d3d48d3873bd086a207a811f221186d80e61da",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
